From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 04:32:16 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 38/48] fate/mov: test depth images and tracks

A HEIF image with a hidden depth item (auxC urn:mpeg:hevc:2015:auxid:2
with a depth representation information message in its aux_subtype and
an auxl reference to the texture item), and the same remuxed to MP4 as
an auxiliary depth track.

The sample, heif/depth.heic, needs to be uploaded to the FATE suite.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5 via Claude Code
---
Refreshed for FFmpeg 9.1 (deb-multimedia 10:9.1-dmo1), 2026-11-26: the context moved in FFmpeg 9.1; the lines this patch adds and removes are unchanged

diff --git a/tests/fate/mov.mak b/tests/fate/mov.mak
index e467acdafbde86b7e8a9162cd165d520da9bd08e..8eee65eecdfd7bf078a58497e835c2a5f460703f 100644
--- a/tests/fate/mov.mak
+++ b/tests/fate/mov.mak
@@ -313,6 +313,19 @@ FATE_MOV_FFMPEG_FFPROBE_SAMPLES-$(call FRAMECRC, MOV, HEVC, HEVC_PARSER) \
 fate-mov-heic-demux-still-image-gainmap-tmap: CMD = stream_demux mov $(TARGET_SAMPLES)/heif/gain_map_tmap.heic "" "-c:v copy -map 0:g:0 -map 0:4" \
   "-of compact -show_entries stream_group=index,id,nb_streams,type:stream_group_components:stream_group_disposition:stream_group_tags:stream_group_side_data:stream_group_stream=index,id:stream_group_stream_disposition:stream_group_stream_side_data_list"
 
+# heic demuxing - still image with a depth image: the depth item's auxiliary
+# type (auxC) and the depth representation information of its aux_subtype
+FATE_MOV_FFMPEG_FFPROBE_SAMPLES-$(call FRAMECRC, MOV, HEVC, HEVC_PARSER) \
+                           += fate-mov-heic-demux-depth
+fate-mov-heic-demux-depth: CMD = stream_demux mov $(TARGET_SAMPLES)/heif/depth.heic "" "-c:v copy -map 0" \
+  "-of compact -show_entries stream=index,codec_name,pix_fmt,width,height:stream_disposition=default,dependent:stream_side_data_list"
+
+# the depth image remuxed as an auxiliary video track: auxv handler, auxi
+# with the depth type and an auxl reference to the texture track
+FATE_MOV_FFMPEG_FFPROBE_SAMPLES-$(call REMUX, MP4 MOV, HEVC_DECODER HEVC_PARSER) \
+                          += fate-mov-mp4-auxiliary-depth
+fate-mov-mp4-auxiliary-depth: CMD = transcode mov $(TARGET_SAMPLES)/heif/depth.heic mp4 "-map 0 -c copy" "-map 0 -c copy" "-of compact -show_entries stream=index,codec_tag_string:stream_side_data_list"
+
 # Resulting remux should have:
 # 1. first audio stream with AV_DISPOSITION_HEARING_IMPAIRED
 # 2. second audio stream with AV_DISPOSITION_VISUAL_IMPAIRED | DESCRIPTIONS
